            "pinyin": "Shǒujī kuài méi diàn le.",
            "gloss": "The phone is almost out of battery."
          }
        }
      ],
      "grammar": [
        {
          "id": "g_gei",
          "title": "給 — to / for someone",
          "pattern": "Verb + 給 + Person",
          "explanation": "給 marks the person who receives an action: 打電話給你 = call you, 寄給他 = send to him.",
          "examples": [
